      "content": "Your pain is relentless and your efforts to fight it only give you more reasons to feel like you don't exist. If you no longer see yourself as deserving of life, then please let it be that you can always give yourself the dignity of resting forever with him when your pain finally allows you to. There is no need to carry the weight of living on your own; you can simply exist where you feel safe until your mind pulls you away from this hell you created.",
